UNIT_ID: U-023
NAME: Cells, Generators, Lenses — Object-Oriented Interaction for Iteration and Experimentation
LENS: LENS_ARTIFACT
TYPE: design_principle
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Framework do projektowania interfejsów LLM: cells (input units: sentences, phrases, instructions), generators (model instances: engine, temperature, presence penalty, best of), lenses (output visualizations: list, space, rating, plot); interactions: create, copy, modify, assemble, link, track.
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - cells: create new cells, copy & edit variations, assemble into inputs (drag-and-drop, linking); minimize cells (font size, keywords) to save space
  - generators: create multiple model instances, modify parameters, link to cells (many-to-many), track history (parameter changes, outputs)
  - lenses: link generators to lenses (list, space, rating, plot), assemble lenses (multiple views of same outputs)
