UNIT_ID: U-024
NAME: AI as Provocateur — Critique, Counter-Argument, Questions Instead of Task Completion
LENS: LENS_SYSTEM, LENS_KNOWLEDGE
TYPE: design_principle
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Postulat zmiany metafory interakcji: AI nie jako assistant (completing tasks, optimizing efficiency), lecz jako provocateur (critiquing work, offering counter-arguments, asking questions); double-loop learning (inner: correct mistakes, outer: question underlying policies/goals).
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - provocateur does not complete report, draft email, write code, generate slides
  - instead: critiques work (where arguments thin, what assumptions/biases, alternative perspectives, is it worth doing)
  - engages in discussions, offers counter-arguments, asks questions to stimulate thinking
  - interfaces less like chat, more like notations (argument maps, Toulmin model, Six Thinking Hats)
